    "memoText": "\n \n                          VETO MESSAGE - No. 72\n \nTO THE SENATE:\n \nI am returning herewith, without my approval, the following bill:\n \nSenate Bill Number 6800-A, entitled:\n \n    \"AN  ACT  to  amend  the  state administrative procedure act and the\n      economic development law, in relation to  requiring  the  division\n      for small-business to publish a small business compliance guide\"\n \nTO THE ASSEMBLY:\n \nI am returning herewith, without my approval, the following bill:\n \nAssembly Bill Number 10786-A, entitled:\n \n    \"AN ACT in relation to establishing a Caumsett State Park fire read-\n      iness study\"\n \n    NOT APPROVED\n \n  These  bills  both  require  studies  for which no Funds are allocated\ntherefore objectionable on fiscal  grounds.  For  these  reasons,  I  am\nconstrained to issue a veto.\n\n  These bills are disapproved.                (signed) ANDREW M. CUOMO\n \n                               __________\n",
